# ~/.config/homebrew/Brewfile — the macOS package set.
# Apply: brew bundle --file ~/.config/homebrew/Brewfile
#
# Linux does NOT come through here any more. Arch/Omarchy has its own
# package layer in arch/packages.sh, which mirrors this file entry for
# entry and documents what it deliberately drops. A Linuxbrew box with no
# pacman still falls back to this file, so the OS.mac? guard stays.

